{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012B3PvwjAe2gWCuKykytSSN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_6/projects/faith-evidence-ie/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 47\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 设计：两阶段验证——MVP-1 CED 信号验证（离线）→ MVP-2 端到端训练验证\\\\n  rationale: CED 是核心创新，必须先验证 DeBERTa NLI 能在 DocRED 上区分金标证据与实体共现干扰句（MVP-1），再投入 GPU\\\\n    跑完整训练流水线（MVP-2）。MVP-1 失败则 idea 需 pivot，避免浪费 GPU。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP-1 PASS: CED 信号验证通过，核心假设成立（margin 0.48, accuracy 81.5%, Pearson r 0.34）'\\\\n  rationale: CED margin 4.8× 超过阈值，DeBERTa 判别力主要来自语义蕴含而非词汇重叠（r=0.34 远低于 0.7）。三个需关注项：33.4%\\\\n    gold p_pos < τ=0.5（τ 可能需调低）、44.4% 无 hard negatives（退化为 flat NLI）、少数负 margin 样本（标注噪声）。这些不影响\\\\n    MVP 结论但影响 Research 阶段 CED 调参。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp1_ced_signal\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: PASS — mean_margin=0.4827, accuracy=81.5%, pearson_r=0.3406\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Smoke test 功能性 PASS: ZeRO-2 + QLoRA 兼容，4.9GB/卡，授权启动 MVP-2 SFT'\\\\n  rationale: Smoke test 自报 FAIL 是假阴性——synthetic data format-only reward 产生零 variance，数学上无梯度是正常行为。关键目标全部达成：ZeRO-2+QLoRA+GRPOTrainer\\\\n    兼容、显存充裕（4.9/32GB）、有 reward variance 时梯度正常。Reviewer 独立确认功能性 PASS。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: smoke_test_grpo\\\\n    role: infrastructure\\\\n    result: 功能性 PASS (ZeRO-2+QLoRA, 4×5090, 4.9GB/卡)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 发现 rtx5090-4x 和 gpu-5090-4x-1 为同一台机器（4 GPU），GRPO 三路对比改为串行\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 核实两个 SSH endpoint 返回相同 hostname 和 PID。实际资源 = 4× RTX 5090 32GB，非\\\\n    8 张。串行 3 路 GRPO 预估 ~7-10h（每路 ~2-3h），今天内可完成 MVP-2，暂不需要额外申请 GPU。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: CED r1 训练 step 40 后 mode collapse，启动早停+checkpoint 抢救+cliprange 排查\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现 step 40 后所有指标退化（total_reward 1.79→1.10, f1 0.098→0.012,\\\\n    length 88→547）。clip_ratio 全程为 0 表明 PPO 裁剪未生效，可能是 policy drift 失控的根因。决策：(1) 抢救\\\\n    step 40 checkpoint 作为当前最优；(2) step 70 前不回升则 kill；(3) 排查并修正 cliprange 后重跑。step\\\\n    40 checkpoint 仍可用于 vs SFT 的对比 eval，MVP-2 流程不完全停滞。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: training collapse after step 40, early stopping evaluation in progress\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 10:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill CED r1（F1 归零+无 checkpoint），准备修复配置后重跑 r2\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 确认 step 80 时 f1_reward=0.001（从 peak 0.098 单调下降 50 步），grpo_s3\\\\n    目录为空（无中间 checkpoint），step 40 最优模型不可挽回。继续 1.3h 必产废模型。诊断三个根因：(1) 无 save_steps 配置；(2)\\\\n    reward 权重失衡（format ~0.97 远大于 f1 ~0.001，模型无 f1 梯度信号）；(3) clip_ratio=0 裁剪未生效。决策\\\\n    kill 并修复后重跑 r2。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: KILL — f1_reward 归零, 无 checkpoint, 训练不可挽回\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 11:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: r3 回退 num_iterations=1，隔离变量逐一测试\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer CRITICAL 确认：r2 的 KL 在 step 5 爆到 37亿、step 15 爆到 3400亿，直接导致 loss\\\\n    爆炸+OOM。根因是 num_iterations=2 + QLoRA 4-bit 量化 logits 精度不足，两次迭代间 KL 被放大。r2 同时改了\\\\n    6 个超参，崩溃后无法归因。r3 必须回退 num_iterations=1，保留 reward weighting（reward 0.25→0.42 正常上升证明\\\\n    WeightedRewardFn 有效），一次只改一个变量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: KL explosion + OOM at step 18, num_iterations=2 confirmed as root cause\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: D007 证伪：KL 爆炸根因是 kl_coef + QLoRA 4-bit 不兼容，非 num_iterations。全部 GRPO 重跑\\\\n    kl_coef=0\\\\n  rationale: 3 个 GRPO 实验（num_iterations=1）均在 step 5 触发 KL 爆炸早停（KL 达 10^10 量级）。对比 r1（kl_coef=0/未设）跑了\\\\n    80+ steps 才因 reward imbalance collapse。证据链：所有设 kl_coef=0.05 的实验全部 step 5 爆炸，未设的\\\\n    r1 稳定运行。机理：QLoRA 4-bit 量化噪声导致 ref model 和 training model 的 log-probs 存在系统性偏差，KL(π_θ||π_ref)\\\\n    从第一步就是天文数字。修复：kl_coef=0，依赖 reward weighting + save_steps + KL 监控（logging only）控制稳定性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: KL explosion step 5, kl_coef=0.05, num_iterations=1\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: KL explosion step 5, KL=69.5B\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: KL explosion step 5, KL=50.8B\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: CED r4 采用保守配置：grad_accum=16 + lr=5e-6 + kl_coef=0.5 + warmup 200步，解决 r3\\\\n    单卡 batch=1 + 高 lr 导致的 KL 爆炸\\\\n  rationale: r3 根因明确：单卡无 grad_accum 导致 effective batch=1，梯度噪声极高，5 步内 KL 爆炸至 4.4M。r1-r3\\\\n    三次失败模式不同（mode collapse / OOM / KL explosion），说明 CED reward 本身不是问题，是训练超参不稳定。r4\\\\n    同时修复 3 个因素：(1) grad_accum=16 使 effective batch=16; (2) lr 从 5e-5 降至 5e-6; (3)\\\\n    kl_coef 从 0.05 升至 0.5 加强偏离惩罚; (4) 加 200 步 warmup 稳定初始阶段。需先拿到 extract 和 flatnli\\\\n    r1 结果作为对照基线。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: failed - KL explosion at step 5, batch=1 root cause\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r4\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: pending approval\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 12:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 选择 Option A：保留 kl_coef=0.0 实验进程，修复 registry 状态从 killed → RUNNING；D009 的\\\\n    kl_coef=0.5 正式作废\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 报告 registry-reality 不一致。3 个实验实际在跑（kl_coef=0.0, grad_acc=16）但\\\\n    registry 标记 killed。配置本身正确——D008 已证明 kl_coef>0 在 QLoRA 4-bit 下不稳定（r1 kl_coef=0\\\\n    稳定 80 步 vs 所有 kl_coef>0 爆炸）。D009 提出的 kl_coef=0.5 会放大 QLoRA 量化噪声导致的 KL 计算失真，Reviewer\\\\n    warning 合理，该指令作废。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r4\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: running with kl_coef=0.0, registry fix needed\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r2\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: running with kl_coef=0.0, registry fix needed\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r2\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: running with kl_coef=0.0, registry fix needed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 13:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 评估框架审查：精确化 pass criteria、补充 extraction-only vs SFT 对比、要求多 checkpoint\\\\n    eval + 统一 eval 脚本\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 4 个 warning：(1) 缺 extraction-only vs SFT 对比——回答 GRPO 本身是否有效；(2)\\\\n    kl_coef=0 必须 eval 多 checkpoint 避免 collapse 后只看末尾；(3) pass criteria 需精确化基准；(4)\\\\n    eval 代码必须统一。全部采纳，已更新 ROADMAP 和指令 Agent。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r5\\\\n    role: target\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r3\\\\n    role: target\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: target\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_sft_eval_r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: 调整 MVP-2 pass criteria：取消绝对 F1>45 门槛，改为相对标准；EDCR 升为主指标\\\\n  rationale: SFT baseline F1=40.57%（37% 输出截断于 1024 tokens），绝对门槛 F1>45 已不现实。截断影响所有模型相同，相对对比仍有效。Evi-F1=79.79%\\\\n    设了高 baseline，但 EDCR=71.18% 说明模型\\\\\\\"spray-and-pray\\\\\\\"大量引用 distractor——CED 的核心攻击目标。调整后\\\\n    pass criteria：(1) CED_Evi-F1 ≥ SFT_Evi-F1（方向正确）；(2) CED_F1 ≥ max(extract, SFT)\\\\n    - 5pp（不退化）；(3) CED_EDCR 显著低于 SFT_EDCR（核心判据）；(4) CED > flat-NLI 在 Evi-F1 或 EDCR\\\\n    上方向正确。绝对指标留到 post-MVP 增大 max_new_tokens 后重评。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_sft_eval_r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: F1=40.57%, Evi-F1=79.79%, EDCR=71.18%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP-2 pass criteria 调整：取消绝对 F1>45 门槛，改为相对对比；EDCR 升为核心判定指标\\\\n  rationale: SFT baseline F1=40.57%（37% 输出被 1024 token 截断导致），已低于原定 F1>45 门槛。但截断对所有模型等效影响，相对对比仍然公平。调整后\\\\n    pass criteria：(1) 核心不变：CED_Evi-F1 − SFT_Evi-F1 ≥ 2pp；(2) F1 改为相对：CED_F1 ≥ SFT_F1\\\\n    − 5pp（即 ≥35.57）；(3) 新增 EDCR 核心判定：CED_EDCR 显著低于 SFT_EDCR（71.18%），降幅 ≥10pp 视为强证据；(4)\\\\n    保持 CED > flat-NLI 方向。SFT EDCR=71% 说明 SFT 模型大量引用 entity-sharing distractors，正是\\\\n    CED 设计目标的攻击面。即使 Evi-F1 提升不足 2pp，EDCR 大幅下降也足以支撑 Claim 2。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_sft_eval_r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: F1=40.57%, Evi-F1=79.79%, EDCR=71.18%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: CED r5 mode collapse 确认 kill；CED reward 必须加 F1 门控防止短输出 hack；暂停 ced_kl001\\\\n  rationale: CED r5 在 65% 进度完全 collapse：completion 固定 34 tokens，f1_reward=0，ced_reward≈0.99，entropy≈0。模型发现极短输出不引用\\\\n    distractor 即可获得近完美 CED 分——CED 自身被 reward hack。根因：CED reward 不依赖抽取质量，模型可在 F1=0\\\\n    时仍获高 CED reward。修复方案：F1 门控——仅在 completion 包含 ≥1 个 predicted triple 时计算 CED reward，否则\\\\n    CED=0。这确保 evidence quality 的评估以有效抽取为前提。ced_kl001 使用同样有缺陷的 reward 设计，必须暂停，等修复后再启动。extract_r3\\\\n    部分 collapse 但仍有 F1 信号，继续观察。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r5\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: 'mode collapse: f1=0, ced≈0.99, 34-token fixed output'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r3\\\\n    role: monitoring\\\\n    result: 'partial collapse: f1=0.2-0.34, 43-50 tokens, trending down'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: healthy\\\\n    result: 'healthy: entropy=0.087, grad_norm=0.398, 11% progress'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: ced_r5 mode collapse 保留跑完取分析价值；flatnli_r3 kill 并修复 NLI device 后重启\\\\n  rationale: ced_r5 在 63% 进度时 f1_reward=0 + entropy≈0，已 mode collapse。保留跑完因为：(1) negative\\\\n    result 证明纯 CED reward 导致 collapse，支撑 reward balance 的 ablation story；(2) 早期 checkpoint\\\\n    可能有 f1_reward 正常的版本可用。flatnli_r3 因 NLI 推理在 CPU 上运行导致 10x 减速（124s/it vs 12s/it），预计\\\\n    20h+。RTX 5090 32GB 有足够余量放 DeBERTa-v3-base (~400MB)，kill 后修复 device 配置重启可将时间降至\\\\n    2-3h。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r5\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: f1_reward=0, mode collapse at 63%\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: NLI on CPU, 10x slowdown, killed for restart\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:00 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill ced_r5 (total collapse)，ced_kl001 移到 cuda:0 立即启动\\\\n  rationale: ced_r5 step 250+ f1_reward=0、completion 坍缩到 34 tokens、save_total_limit=5\\\\n    已覆盖所有正常 checkpoint。继续跑无任何回收价值。Kill 后释放 cuda:0 给 ced_kl001（kl_coef=0.01），不再等 cuda:1。ced_kl001\\\\n    现在是 MVP-2 最关键实验——验证 CED+KL约束能否避免 reward hacking。extract_r3 和 flatnli_r3 保持 kl=0\\\\n    继续跑，作为对照：若它们没 collapse，说明问题是 CED reward 特异的；若也 collapse，说明 kl=0 通病。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_r5\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: total mode collapse, killed\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001\\\\n    role: replacement\\\\n    result: moved to cuda:0, critical experiment\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill ced_r5 + extract_r3 (kl_coef=0 collapse/stall), 部署 kl_coef=0.01 修正实验\\\\n  rationale: 3路GRPO健康检查：ced_r5完全mode collapse(entropy=0.0005, F1=0, grad_norm=0)，extract_r3训练停滞(grad_norm=0,\\\\n    F1=0.20低于SFT baseline 0.4057)。共同根因kl_coef=0导致策略无约束偏移。D008显示kl_coef=0.05会KL爆炸，选择0.01作为中间值（5x低于爆炸阈值）。flatnli_r3保留作为kl_coef=0对照组继续观察。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_r5\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: mode collapse, entropy=0.0005, F1=0\\\\n  - exp_id: extract_r3\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: stalled, grad_norm=0, F1=0.20\\\\n  - exp_id: flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: healthy at 10.7%, continue as kl_coef=0 control\\\\n  - exp_id: D008\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: kl_coef=0.05 caused KL explosion\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: flatnli_r3 紧急修复 reward_device cpu→cuda，extract_r3 改为跑完再替换\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 发现 D015 未执行：flatnli_r3 仍以 --reward_device cpu 运行，step_time\\\\n    123s/step（GPU 后应 12-15s/step），cuda:3 被占用但 90% 时间等 CPU。修复后从 ~23h 降至 ~2-3h，是当前最高\\\\n    ROI 操作。extract_r3 已 68%（~50min 完成），改为跑完后再部署 extract_kl001，避免浪费已投入的 2.5h。ced_r5\\\\n    维持 kill（3.3h GPU 时间用于 ced_kl001 更有价值）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: fix\\\\n    result: reward_device cpu→cuda, from checkpoint-80 resume\\\\n  - exp_id: extract_r3\\\\n    role: revised\\\\n    result: let finish (~50min), then replace with extract_kl001\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_r5\\\\n    role: kill\\\\n    result: maintain kill decision, replace with ced_kl001\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 D017：extract_r3 改为跑完再释放，flatnli_r3 紧急补执行 D015（修复 NLI device 重启）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现：(1) D015 未执行——flatnli_r3 仍用 CPU NLI，step_time 120s vs GPU\\\\n    应 12-15s，23h→2-3h 的 10x 效率差，cuda:3 90% 时间在等 CPU。(2) extract_r3 只剩 ~50min，跑完可取早期\\\\n    checkpoint（collapse 前 step 20-100 可能比 last 好），不值得 kill 浪费已投入的 2.5h。修正后：cuda:0\\\\n    立即释放给 ced_kl001，cuda:2 等 50min 后给 extract_kl001，cuda:3 kill+修复 NLI device 后从 ckpt-80\\\\n    重启。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: fix\\\\n    result: D015 未执行，NLI 在 CPU 导致 10x 低效，需 kill+修复+重启\\\\n  - exp_id: extract_r3\\\\n    role: revised\\\\n    result: 改为跑完（~50min），eval 早期 checkpoint\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_r5\\\\n    role: kill\\\\n    result: 仍立即 kill，与 D017 一致\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: ced_kl001 启动前必须先修复 CED reward F1 门控（D014 未实现）；kl_coef=0.01 实验改为 100 步探测性运行\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 代码核查确认 D014 的 F1 门控从未实现：ced_reward.py 对 0-triple 短输出仍给近完美分(0.99)。ced_r5\\\\n    的 collapse 根因是双重的——kl_coef=0 导致策略自由偏移 + CED reward 对短输出的 hack。仅修 kl_coef 不解决 reward\\\\n    设计缺陷，ced_kl001 会重复失败。同时 kl_coef=0.01+QLoRA 的兼容性未验证（D008 证明 0.05 爆炸），先做 100 步探测降低风险。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_r5\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 34-token 短输出 → CED≈0.99 → reward hack → collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_kl001\\\\n    role: blocked\\\\n    result: 等 CED reward 修复后才能启动\\\\n  - exp_id: D008\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: kl_coef=0.05+QLoRA KL 爆炸\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D017\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill flatnli_r5（从已 hacked checkpoint 恢复无效），启动 flatnli_r6 从 SFT 全新训练 D020\\\\n    配置\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立审查发现 flatnli_r3 checkpoint-100 已深陷 NLI reward hacking（f1=0.025,\\\\n    flat_nli=0.911）。从该 checkpoint 恢复加 kl_coef=0.01 后 KL=0.46（远高于从 SFT 新训的 ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    的 0.098），frac_zero_std 升至 0.8-0.9，grad_norm 近零——训练冻结。教训：从 kl=0 已漂移 checkpoint\\\\n    恢复并加 kl>0 不可行，必须从 SFT 全新开始。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r5\\\\n    role: 被 kill\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r3\\\\n    role: 提供了已 hacked 的 checkpoint\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: 健康参照（从 SFT 新训）\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill extract_r4 (f1_reward=0 at ckpt-30, mode collapse confirmed); cuda:2\\\\n    转 ced_kl001_r4 多 checkpoint eval\\\\n  rationale: extract_r4 (extraction-only, kl_coef=0.01+gen=8) 在 step 10 后 f1_reward\\\\n    归零、frac_zero_std≥0.8 停滞，checkpoint-30 无恢复信号。同配置的 ced_kl001_r4 在 step 20 f1_reward=0.082\\\\n    持续上升——直接证明 CED reward 通道是驱动学习的关键因素。这一负面结果本身是强证据，不再尝试 extract_r5。cuda:2 空闲，派去 eval\\\\n    ced_kl001_r4 中间 checkpoint，提前获取多 checkpoint 评估数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r4\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: f1_reward=0 at ckpt-30, mode collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: f1_reward=0.082 at step 20, healthy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Kill extract_r4 (mode collapse confirmed); ablation 结论: CED reward 是 GRPO\\\\n    训练必需的 dense signal，extraction-only reward 太稀疏无法驱动学习'\\\\n  rationale: 'extract_r4 checkpoint-30: f1_reward 连续 25 步为 0，frac_zero_std 升至 0.9，grad_norm\\\\n    在 0.005-0.012 震荡。对比 ced_kl001_r4 同期（f1_reward=0.082 持续上升，frac_zero_std=0.4 持续下降），唯一差异是\\\\n    reward type。结论: Stage 1 (extract-only) 在 D020 配置下无法维持 GRPO 探索多样性，CED 提供的 dense\\\\n    reward signal 是训练成功的必要条件。这是论文的关键 ablation evidence。cuda:2 释放，分配给 SFT eval baseline。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r4\\\\n    role: failed_ablation\\\\n    result: mode collapse — f1_reward=0 for 25 steps\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: positive_control\\\\n    result: f1_reward=0.082 at step 20, healthy training\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Kill flatnli_r6 (mode collapse step 25); D020 配置下三路 ablation 结论: 仅 CED\\\\n    reward 存活，extract-only 和 flat-NLI 均 collapse'\\\\n  rationale: 'flatnli_r6 step 25: frac_zero_std=0.9, f1_reward=0, flat_nli_reward=0,\\\\n    reward 100% 来自 format。与 extract_r4 collapse 模式一致。三个实验共用 D020 配置（kl=0.01, gen=8），唯一差异是\\\\n    reward type: extract-only collapse (step 10-30), flat-NLI collapse (step 25),\\\\n    CED 健康完成 100 步。结论: CED 的对比性 evidence discrimination 提供了 GRPO 所需的 dense gradient\\\\n    signal，是训练成功的必要条件。这比原设想的\\\\\\\"CED 改善 evidence quality\\\\\\\"更强——CED 是 GRPO 训练本身能否存活的关键。cuda:3\\\\n    释放用于加速 eval。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r6\\\\n    role: failed_ablation\\\\n    result: mode collapse step 25, frac_zero_std=0.9\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r4\\\\n    role: failed_ablation\\\\n    result: mode collapse step 10-30\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: positive_control\\\\n    result: 100 steps healthy, reward 0.85-1.37\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill flatnli_r6 (mode collapse confirmed step 25); D020 配置下三路 ablation\\\\n    结论：仅 CED reward 存活，extract-only 和 flat-NLI 均 collapse\\\\n  rationale: 'flatnli_r6 step 25: frac_zero_std=0.9, f1_reward=0, flat_nli_reward=0,\\\\n    reward 100% 来自 format。与 extract_r4 collapse 模式一致。D020 配置（kl=0.01, gen=8）下三路对比：extract-only\\\\n    step 30 collapse, flat-NLI step 25 collapse, CED 100 步健康完成。唯一差异是 reward type。结论：CED\\\\n    的对比性 evidence discrimination 提供了更丰富的梯度信号，是维持 GRPO 探索多样性的必要条件。这是论文最核心的 ablation\\\\n    evidence — 但需注意区分\\\\\\\"CED reward 本身的 anti-collapse 特性\\\\\\\"与\\\\\\\"stage 3 组合 reward 的其他差异\\\\\\\"两个假设。cuda:3\\\\n    释放后用于 eval 加速。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_flatnli_r6\\\\n    role: failed_ablation\\\\n    result: mode collapse step 25, frac_zero_std=0.9\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_extract_r4\\\\n    role: failed_ablation\\\\n    result: mode collapse step 30, f1_reward=0\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: positive_control\\\\n    result: 100 steps healthy, reward=0.85-1.37\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP-2 ced_kl001_r4 FAIL — lr=5e-5 导致灾难性遗忘+CED recall shortcut 双重问题，启动 P0/P0+P1\\\\n    并行修复\\\\n  rationale: 'ckpt-10/50/100 eval 全部远低于 SFT baseline（rel_f1: 0.003→0.156→0.217 vs\\\\n    SFT 0.4057，evi_f1: 0.720→0.564→0.575 vs SFT 0.7979）。训练 reward 5x 增长但 eval F1 未恢复，确认\\\\n    reward hacking + 灾难性遗忘双重机制。根因：lr=5e-5 过高 5-10x + CED 对非匹配 triple 无 recall 惩罚。D020\\\\n    ablation 的 CED 训练稳定性发现仍有效。下一步：P0（lr=5e-6）和 P0+P1（lr=5e-6 + ced_recall_penalty）并行验证。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: training success but eval fail\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_ckpt10\\\\n    role: eval\\\\n    result: f1=0.003\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_step50\\\\n    role: eval\\\\n    result: f1=0.156\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_step100\\\\n    role: eval\\\\n    result: f1=0.217\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP-2 ced_kl001_r4 FAIL — lr=5e-5 过高导致灾难性遗忘+CED recall shortcut 叠加 reward\\\\n    hacking\\\\n  rationale: ckpt-10/50/100 三点轨迹确认：rel_f1 最高 0.217（SFT 0.4057, pass 0.356, gap -13.9pp），evi_f1\\\\n    最高 0.575（SFT 0.7979, pass 0.818, gap -24.3pp）。恢复速率递减（40步+15.3pp→50步+6.0pp），外推至\\\\n    step200 仍远低于 pass。根因：(1) lr=5e-5 是社区推荐的 5-10x，导致 step10 即灾难性遗忘；(2) CED shortcut\\\\n    使非匹配 triple 退化为 flat NLI，引导模型少预测高 EDCR；(3) train/eval 分布不匹配放大差距。下一步：P0(lr=5e-6)\\\\n    + P0+P1(lr=5e-6+recall_penalty) 并行。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success(training)/fail(eval)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_step100\\\\n    role: eval\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.217,evi_f1=0.575\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_ckpt50\\\\n    role: eval\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.156,evi_f1=0.564\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_ced_kl001_r4_ckpt10\\\\n    role: eval\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.003,evi_f1=0.720\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill rp_r2 (P0+P1) — loss 指数 divergence 不可恢复；cuda:3 转跑 rp_r2 ckpt-20 eval\\\\n    关闭对比线\\\\n  rationale: rp_r2 loss 从 step 10-20 持续指数增长 (908→24650→1.34e7)，根因是 recall_penalty\\\\n    5-10x 梯度 + kl_coef=0.01 形成正反馈循环。与 P0 的瞬时 KL spike 不同，这是持续 divergence。Kill 后 cuda:3\\\\n    跑 rp_r2 ckpt-20 eval（成本低，~2h）拿到数据关闭 P0+P1 对比线。不启动新训练——MVP 阶段 P0 单独通过即可。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_rp_r2\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: loss exponential divergence\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: P0 continues as sole MVP path\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 rp_r2 终止理由：从\\\\\\\"loss 持续发散\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"recall penalty 过度抑制 CED 信号\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立核实 trainer_state.json 发现 rp_r2 step 30-40 的 loss/KL 已完全恢复正常（loss=0.038,\\\\n    KL=0.005），与 P0 的瞬态发散→恢复模式一致，不是持续发散。真正的问题是 ced_reward=0.005 远低于 P0 的 0.079，说明 recall\\\\n    penalty 过于严苛压制了 CED 学习信号。kill 决策本身不撤回，但论文引用此 negative result 时应表述为\\\\\\\"recall penalty\\\\n    过度抑制 CED 信号\\\\\\\"而非\\\\\\\"训练发散\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: rp_r2\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: killed-但理由修正\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_train_lr5e6_r1\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: 同样出现瞬态发散后恢复\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: P0 ckpt-20 eval FAIL (rel_f1=0.0077); lr=5e-6 未能防止早期遗忘，与 lr=5e-5 相同模式；扩展至全\\\\n    checkpoint 轨迹评估\\\\n  rationale: lr=5e-5 和 lr=5e-6 在 step-20 均出现灾难性遗忘（rel_f1 < 0.01），说明问题不是单纯 LR 过高——GRPO+QLoRA\\\\n    在结构化生成任务上的前 20 步 inherently 不稳定（60% 输出截断，field compliance 仅 39.9%）。需要看完整 recovery\\\\n    trajectory（ckpt-40/60/80）才能判断是否\\\\\\\"先崩后恢复\\\\\\\"。ced_kl001_r4 (lr=5e-5) step-90 最高 0.211\\\\n    仍低于阈值，lr=5e-6 能否突破 0.30 存疑。同时开始考虑 GRPO 替代方案（DPO/rejection sampling）作为 contingency。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt20\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: rel_f1=0.0077, 39x below threshold'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1\\\\n    role: training\\\\n    result: step ~68, f1_reward recovering at step 45\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: GRPO+QLoRA P0 方向判死：ckpt-40 rel_f1=0.0071（比 ckpt-20 更差），两个 LR 均远劣于 SFT baseline。Pivot\\\\n    到离线 RL（Rejection Sampling FT → DPO）\\\\n  rationale: ckpt-20→ckpt-40 轨迹下降（0.0077→0.0071），GRPO 只学会格式/证据引用但完全丧失关系抽取能力。lr=5e-5\\\\n    最佳 0.211 vs SFT 0.406，lr=5e-6 最佳 0.008。catastrophic forgetting 是 GRPO+QLoRA 在结构化生成任务上的根本性问题，非超参可解。CED\\\\n    reward signal 本身有效（MVP-1 verified），问题在在线 RL 训练方法论。Pivot 到离线方法：(1) Rejection Sampling\\\\n    FT 最简单最稳定优先做 (2) DPO+CED scoring 作为并行备选。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt40_r2\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.0071 FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt20\\\\n    role: prior\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.0077 FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1\\\\n    role: training\\\\n    result: f1_reward 无学习趋势\\\\n  - exp_id: ced_kl001_r4\\\\n    role: prior_attempt\\\\n    result: best 0.211 at ckpt-90, mode collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Kill GRPO 训练 (cuda:0 step 113/200): 轨迹数据已充分，释放 GPU 给 RSFT 管线加速'\\\\n  rationale: ckpt-80 rel_f1=0.0116 (SFT baseline 的 2.9%)，ckpt-20→80 全线 FAIL。ckpt-100\\\\n    eval 在跑会给最后一个数据点，但 step 200 无价值。释放 cuda:0 可用于并行 RSFT generate 或后续 scoring/training。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: trajectory ckpt-20~80 all FAIL, max rel_f1=0.0116\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt80\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.0116 negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: D031 最终确认：GRPO+QLoRA 全线 FAIL，lr5e6 全 6 checkpoint rel_f1 < 0.02；negative\\\\n    result 模式有论文价值（CED↑ + rel_f1 catastrophic forgetting = 在线 RL 无法维持双能力）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立核实 lr5e6 全 6 checkpoint：rel_f1 最高仅 0.0138（阈值 0.30），evi_f1\\\\n    从 0.628 单调升至 0.850（超 SFT 0.798），edcr 稳定 ~0.99（远超 SFT 0.712）。模式：CED reward signal\\\\n    有效驱动 evidence 质量提升，但在线 RL (GRPO+QLoRA) 导致关系抽取 catastrophic forgetting。此 negative\\\\n    result 直接支持离线 RL (RSFT/DPO) 路线的必要性，且为论文提供重要论据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt100\\\\n    role: final_eval\\\\n    result: FAIL rel_f1=0.0138\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt80\\\\n    role: trajectory\\\\n    result: FAIL rel_f1=0.0116\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt60\\\\n    role: trajectory\\\\n    result: FAIL rel_f1=0.0093\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt40\\\\n    role: trajectory\\\\n    result: FAIL rel_f1=0.0071\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_lr5e6_r1_ckpt20\\\\n    role: trajectory\\\\n    result: FAIL rel_f1=0.0077\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_grpo_ced_lr5e6_r1\\\\n    role: training\\\\n    result: killed after trajectory data collected\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D034: RSFT diversity 危机——diversity=1.0/8 因 temperature 未生效，暂停生成并修复'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 发现：(1) rsft_generate.py 传入 temperature=0.7 但被 Qwen3-4B\\\\n    generation_config.json 自带的 T=0.6/top_k=20 覆盖，transformers 打出 WARNING 但 Agent 未注意；(2)\\\\n    SFT 后模型分布极度尖锐，T=0.6+top_k=20 几乎等同于 greedy，导致 8 次生成完全相同；(3) 早期 diversity_probe\\\\n    报告 7/8 是 format 解析 bug 导致的虚假多样性，修复格式后真实 diversity 暴露为 1.0/8。必须 kill 当前进程、修复 temperature\\\\n    覆盖（显式设 model.generation_config.temperature + top_k=0）、用 3-5 doc 验证后再重启。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_generate\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: diversity=1.0/8, 生成数据无法用于 rejection sampling\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_diversity_probe\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 7/8 是虚假多样性（format bug），实际 5.0/8 且修复后降至 1.0/8\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 暂停 RSFT 并行化：Reviewer critical 发现 diversity=1.0/8 是格式修复后的真实值，之前 7/8 为格式不一致假象。高温探针优先。\\\\n  rationale: diversity_probe 原始数据 (8,6,1) 平均 5.0/8 而非上报的 7；且 probe 时 format_ok 仅 34%，\\\\\\\"多样性\\\\\\\"来自\\\\n    JSON key 名变体。生产环境 format_ok=99.8% 后实测 diversity=1.0/8。继续当前配置生成 14h 的数据毫无意义——rejection\\\\n    sampling 退化为普通 SFT。需先用高温(T=1.0/1.2/1.5)探针验证 diversity 是否可恢复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_diversity_probe\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 虚报 7/8, 实际 5.0/8, 且为格式假象\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_generate\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: diversity=1.0/8 at T=0.7, 暂不扩展\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 01:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: D034 撤销：diversity crisis 是监控 bug，非生成质量问题，T=0.7 下 diversity 充足(7.11/8)，恢复并行生成\\\\n  rationale: 独立验证 Worker 分析 cuda:1 已生成的 200 docs：triple-set diversity 7.11/8 (median=8.0)，format\\\\n    parse rate 90.2%，61.5% 文档 8/8 完全不同。之前监控报告 mean_diversity=1.0/8 为度量代码计算错误。无需执行\\\\n    D034 的 temperature 修复和高温探针。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_generate\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: diversity monitoring bug identified\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 07:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D037: RSFT 全线 FAIL（rel_f1=0.0483），pivot 到 CED-as-reranker（推理时方案）'\\\\n  rationale: 'GRPO（D027/D031/D033）和 RSFT 两条训练路线均呈现相同的灾难性遗忘——任何对 SFT checkpoint 的二次微调都摧毁\\\\n    rel_f1。RSFT r1: rel_f1=0.0483, num_preds=848（SFT baseline: 0.4057, 12234）。跨 seed\\\\n    方差 <0.04%，非随机。根因假设：LoRA 二次微调的系统性遗忘。Pivot 到 CED-as-reranker：SFT 模型生成 N 候选 → CED\\\\n    打分 → 选最佳，完全绕过训练问题。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: rel_f1=0.0483'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s43\\\\n    role: variance\\\\n    result: training variance <0.04%\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44\\\\n    role: variance\\\\n    result: eval pending, same outcome expected\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 09:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D038: 撤回 D037——RSFT \\\\\\\"灾难性失败\\\\\\\"实为 eval bug（50-doc pred vs 12275 gold denominator\\\\n    mismatch），s44 全量 eval 通过 MVP-2（rel_f1=0.4655 +5.98pp, evi_f1=0.8087 +1.08pp）'\\\\n  rationale: r1 的 rel_f1=0.0483 是评估代码 bug：TaskEvalCallback 在 50 docs 上生成预测但 gold triples\\\\n    用了全量 dev set 12275 条，recall 被人为压到 ~3.5%。s44 独立全量 eval（985 docs）结果：rel_f1=0.4655（+5.98pp\\\\n    vs SFT 0.4057），evi_f1=0.8087（+1.08pp vs 0.7979），edcr=0.6350（-7.68pp vs 0.7118）。CED\\\\n    rejection sampling 首次端到端验证成功。D037 的 reranker pivot 基于错误数据，RSFT 实际有效。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'PASS: rel_f1=0.4655, evi_f1=0.8087'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1\\\\n    role: pending_reeval\\\\n    result: r1 0.0483 was eval bug, full eval needed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D039: RSFT+CED ablation 全部 PASS MVP-2——方法鲁棒，1 epoch 足够，EDCR 局限需论文讨论'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立验证 4 组 RSFT 配置（r1 s42/s44, r2a, r2b）全部通过 MVP-2 判据（rel_f1 >\\\\n    0.4057, evi_f1 > 0.798）。核心发现：(1) RSFT+CED 方法贡献 +4-6pp rel_f1，具体超参影响极小（0.45pp 范围内），方法鲁棒性好；(2)\\\\n    1 epoch 足够，3 epoch 无显著额外收益；(3) r2b 保守 LoRA scaling+低 lr 略优于 r2a（截断更少、字段完整率更高）；(4)\\\\n    EDCR 一致偏高 63-66%，CED reward 对 rel_f1 提升明显但对证据精确度提升有限，需论文坦诚讨论。两个 warning（ablation\\\\n    变量混淆、EDCR 高）均不阻塞 MVP，clean ablation 留研究阶段补。等 s43_r2 第三种子确认后调 complete_mvp()。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4494, evi_f1=0.8108, EDCR=0.6641, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b\\\\n    role: ablation\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4493, evi_f1=0.8128, EDCR=0.6609, 截断179/字段完整率81.8%, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r1\\\\n    role: baseline_rsft\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4449, evi_f1=0.8187, EDCR=0.6565, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44\\\\n    role: seed_variance\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4655, evi_f1=0.8087, PASS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D038\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D040: MVP 正式通过 → 进入 Research 阶段。paper_framing.md 定稿（RSFT+CED 路线，4 Claims），experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n    建立（10 研究实验），dream_simulate(full) 已启动'\\\\n  rationale: D039 已判定 MVP-2 全部 PASS（4/4 configs），但 complete_mvp() 未被调用。用户催促后补调。Post-MVP\\\\n    kickoff 按 skill 流程执行：(1) paper_framing.md 从 Pre-MVP draft 更新为 Post-MVP 定稿版——方法从\\\\n    GRPO 转为 RSFT+CED，新增 Claim 3（在线 RL catastrophic forgetting 分析）和 RC6/RC7；(2) experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n    新建，10 个研究实验分 P0/P1/P2；(3) dream_simulate(full) 已启动（dream_20260515T120227），等回调后再批准\\\\n    P0 实验。投稿目标调整为 ARR July → EMNLP 2026 Main（ARR May 25 仅作 stretch goal）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4494 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4493 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r1\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4449 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_rsft_train_r1_s44\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: rel_f1=0.4655 PASS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D041: Evi-F1 评测协议不一致确认——我们的\\\\\\\"条件 Evi-F1\\\\\\\"(仅 TP triples)与 DREEAM\\\\\\\"联合 Evi-F1\\\\\\\"(含\\\\n    FP/FN 惩罚)不可比，publishability threshold 暂冻结等对齐后重评'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 调查确认：我们的 compute_evi_f1() 在 FP triple 时 continue 跳过（precision 分母只算\\\\n    TP evidence），recall 分母也只算 matched gold triples。DREEAM 的 official_evaluate() 将\\\\n    FP/FN 全部计入分母。在 rel_recall ≈ 55% 时，分母差约 1.8x，解释了 82% vs 57% 的差距。已派 Agent 实现 DREEAM\\\\n    协议对齐函数并重新评估全部实验。在对齐数字出来前，paper_framing.md 的 publishability threshold（Evi-F1 >\\\\n    57.34）暂冻结。条件 Evi-F1 仍作为辅助指标保留（衡量\\\\\\\"关系对了时 evidence 选得好不好\\\\\\\"）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_sft_eval_r2\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: evi_f1_conditional=0.7979, joint TBD\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r1\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: evi_f1_conditional=0.8187, joint TBD\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: evi_f1_conditional=0.8108, joint TBD\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: evi_f1_conditional=0.8128, joint TBD\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n  - D040\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D041: Evi-F1 评测协议与 DREEAM 不一致——我们的 conditional Evi-F1 跳过 FP/FN triples，比\\\\n    DREEAM 的 joint Evi-F1 宽松得多。必须实现 DREEAM 协议对齐后重算所有实验。Publishability threshold 待重算后修订'\\\\n  rationale: Agent 调查确认：我们的 compute_evi_f1() 在 FP triple 时 continue 跳过，precision 分母只算\\\\n    TP；recall 分母也只算已匹配 gold。DREEAM 的 official_evaluate() 把 FP/FN 全部计入分母。关系 recall\\\\n    ~55% 时，分母差异完全解释 82% vs 57% 的差距。对齐方案：加 FP evidence 到 precision 分母 + 遍历全部 gold triple\\\\n    evidence 到 recall 分母。论文需要报告 DREEAM 协议数字（与文献可比），条件 Evi-F1 可作为辅助指标（衡量\\\\\\\"关系正确时 evidence\\\\n    选择质量\\\\\\\"）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_sft_eval_r2\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: conditional evi_f1=0.7979, dreeam evi_f1 待重算\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r1\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: conditional evi_f1=0.8187, dreeam evi_f1 待重算\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2a\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: conditional evi_f1=0.8108, dreeam evi_f1 待重算\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_eval_rsft_r2b\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: conditional evi_f1=0.8128, dreeam evi_f1 待重算\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D039\\\\n  - D040\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D042: Dream 审稿分析——best=2.5/median=3.0/worst=2.5（评分倒挂）。5 个确认行动项（narrow\\\\n    Claim 3 scope、加 GRPO G=8、修 Evi-F1 协议、CED contingency plan、加 DPO baseline），4 个观察项。Framing\\\\n    和 plan 已更新，re-dream 启动'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream 三档审稿分析（dream-report-action 协议）：\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **三档一致的结构性问题（确认行动项）**：\\\\n\\\\n    1. CED vs flat-NLI 可能不显著 → 加 contingency plan，如 p>0.05 则 CED 降级\\\\n\\\\n    2. Title/claims overclaim \\\\\\\"online RL\\\\\\\" → Claim 3 限定为 \\\\\\\"GRPO+QLoRA\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n    3. GRPO G=4 太小 → 加 plan_011 (G=8 实验，P0)\\\\n\\\\n    4. Cross-protocol Evi-F1 → 已在修复中 (D041)\\\\n\\\\n    5. 缺中间 baseline → 加 plan_012 (DPO, P1)\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **两档一致的观察项**：\\\\n\\\\n    - EDCR 需人工验证 [M][W] → plan_013\\\\n\\\\n    - Dev→test 退化 [M][W] → 等 plan_002 真实数据\\\\n\\\\n    - Number discrepancies [B][M] → Dream artifact（虚构数据），真实论文不会有此问题\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **评分倒挂说明**：best(2.5) < median(3.0) 因 best 版本膨胀数字被审稿人识破——说明诚实报告比膨胀结果更重要。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    **判断**：framing 和 plan 已按确认行动项修改，需 re-dream 验证后才能批准 P0 实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D040\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream v1 分析完成：reframe paper_framing.md，CED 降级，claims 重构，新增 3 个实验\\\\n  rationale: Dream v1 (best=2.5, median=3.0, worst=2.5) 三档一致指出：(1) CED vs flat-NLI\\\\n    不显著 p>0.05 → CED 从核心贡献降级为 one possible scoring function；(2) \\\\\\\"online RL fails\\\\\\\"\\\\n    标题过度声称 → 收窄到 \\\\\\\"GRPO fails for DocRE\\\\\\\"；(3) GRPO G=4 太小 → 新增 G=8 实验(plan_011)；(4)\\\\n    缺 DPO baseline → 新增 plan_012；(5) EDCR 缺人工验证 → 新增 plan_013。Claims 重构为 C1=evidence-grounded\\\\n    DocRE 可行性, C2=GRPO decoupling 发现, C3=NLI-based RSFT ablation, C4=EDCR 诊断工具。需 re-dream\\\\n    验证 reframe 效果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011\\\\n    role: new_from_dream\\\\n    result: GRPO G=8 实验，排除 G=4 confound\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_012\\\\n    role: new_from_dream\\\\n    result: DPO+CED，online-offline 中间 baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013\\\\n    role: new_from_dream\\\\n    result: EDCR 100例人工标注验证\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D045\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D045: DPO 升级 P0 + GRPO G=8 排为第一优先；DPO 定位修正为 offline preference optimization'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出：(1) DPO 是纯 offline 方法，不是 online/offline 中间点——论文中错误定位会被审稿人攻击。已修正\\\\n    paper_framing.md。(2) DPO 结果直接决定 C2 叙事走向（on-policy 特有 vs 更 general 的现象），对 paper\\\\n    scope 有重大影响，升级 P0。(3) C2 对 GRPO G=8 单点依赖是最大风险，G=8 必须是 re-dream 后第一个启动的实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_012\\\\n    role: 升级 P0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011\\\\n    role: 第一优先 P0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n- id: D046\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D045: DPO 从 P1 升 P0 + GRPO G=8 定为 re-dream 后首批实验 + topk3 双变体设计'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 路线图审查指出：(1) DPO 结果直接决定 C2 decoupling 叙事——若 DPO 也出现 decoupling\\\\n    则现象更 general，若不出现则确认 on-policy 特有，两种结果都对论文有重大影响，升 P0；(2) C2 publishability 必要条件依赖\\\\n    GRPO G=8 复现 decoupling，是最高风险实验，必须首批启动；(3) topk3 数据含 CED=0 样本会稀释信号，改为双变体并行（全量 vs\\\\n    过滤 CED=0）以区分数据量效应和信号稀释。同时修正 paper_framing.md 中 DPO 定位错误（纯 offline 方法，非 online/offline\\\\n    中间点）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_012\\\\n    role: DPO+CED 升 P0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_011\\\\n    role: GRPO G=8 首批 P0\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_008\\\\n    role: topk3 双变体设计\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D044\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 34024, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sq2QZGoDYHg1UKf13hDhjp","session_id":"5167ddfd-d536-4198-9738-76cb8f0f50e8","uuid":"4b7640c1-ec69-47de-b8f2-b4dec76a3a33","timestamp":"2026-05-15T14:28:18.124Z"}
